    <comment>Update to 1.5.4

- Handle tool schemas with unsupported top-level composition
- Preserve caller tool_choice
- Add user_profile_id convenience attribute

Built and verified on aarch64: 190 tests pass on both python313 and python314,
rpmlint 0 errors / 0 warnings / 0 badness, source_validator clean.</comment>
