    <version>1.6.0</version>
    <time>1787235327</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- Update to 1.6.0:
  * Map Anthropic SDK failures onto the new standard model
    exception types from langchain-core 1.6.0
  * Restrict file-search grep to the requested path so sibling
    directories that only share a name prefix are no longer scanned
- Follow upstream and raise the langchain-core requirement floor
  to 1.6.0

INTERDEPENDENT REQUESTS - please stage together (will not build until these land):
 * python-langchain-core 1.6.0
 * python-langchain-openai 1.6.0 (also carries 1.5.2 vs Factory 1.5.1)
 * python-langchain-anthropic 1.6.0
Devel accepts: sr#1372135 (core), sr#1372136 (openai), sr#1372137 (anthropic).
</comment>
